Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 02:17:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 22/24] ALSA: hda/ca0132: AE-9: refresh the ACM display on
 mixer changes

Volume and mute changes now request a display update 20 ms later instead
of waiting for the next 500 ms service tick.  Display sends are spaced
50 ms apart on their own work item so they cannot push the service
deadline, the UART is checked before writing, every wait is bounded and
the display path stops on error instead of retrying a partial frame.

Based on s3boun3t/ae9_build (displayui1).

Signed-off-by: DarkNikGr <mitakidisnikos@gmail.com>
---
 sound/hda/codecs/ca0132.c | 302 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 285 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

